QuestGuidance.Register("en",411,{
[13121]="7006A166\n1\tPursue Khâshap!\tKhâshap has lured you into the Gut, and has turned the streets against you. Give chase as he makes his way to his master!\n2\tChase Khâshap to the Gate of Sorrow!\tKhâshap has fled deeper into the back streets. Continue your pursuit before he delivers the Bile of Ifrinn!\n3\tDefeat Utho the Grasper\tKhâshap has left you to deal with his most trusted cohort, Utho the Grasper. Defeat Utho the Grasper.\n4\tFollow Khâshap to the Gate of Storms\tKhâshap has taken to the Fleetfast. He is running out of places to run. You must corner him at last!\n5\tDefeat Khâshap, Irinn's Abomination\tKhâshap has been cornered at the Gate of Storms. You must defeat him before he can make his final attempt at delivering this Bile of Ifrinn to his master.\n",
[13122]="7006A16A\n1\tPursue Khâshap!\tKhâshap has lured you into the Gut, and has turned the streets against you. Give chase as he makes his way to his master!\n2\tChase Khâshap to the Gate of Sorrow!\tKhâshap has fled deeper into the back streets. Continue your pursuit before he delivers the Bile of Ifrinn!\n3\tDefeat Utho the Grasper\tKhâshap has left you to deal with his most trusted cohort, Utho the Grasper. Defeat Utho the Grasper.\n4\tFollow Khâshap to the Gate of Storms\tKhâshap has taken to the Fleetfast. He is running out of places to run. You must corner him at last!\n5\tDefeat Khâshap, Irinn's Abomination\tKhâshap has been cornered at the Gate of Storms. You must defeat him before he can make his final attempt at delivering this Bile of Ifrinn to his master.\n",
[13123]="7006A169\n1\tPursue Khâshap!\tKhâshap has lured you into the Gut, and has turned the streets against you. Give chase as he makes his way to his master!\n2\tChase Khâshap to the Gate of Sorrow!\tKhâshap has fled deeper into the back streets. Continue your pursuit before he delivers the Bile of Ifrinn!\n3\tDefeat Utho the Grasper\tKhâshap has left you to deal with his most trusted cohort, Utho the Grasper. Defeat Utho the Grasper.\n4\tFollow Khâshap to the Gate of Storms\tKhâshap has taken to the Fleetfast. He is running out of places to run. You must corner him at last!\n5\tDefeat Khâshap, Irinn's Abomination\tKhâshap has been cornered at the Gate of Storms. You must defeat him before he can make his final attempt at delivering this Bile of Ifrinn to his master.\n",
[13124]="70041788\n1\tNegotiate with the bandit leader\tThe bandit leader can be located in the abandoned district to the north-east of Tol Ciryarani. You should negotiate with the bandit leader.\n2\tTalk to Thandor\tThandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Thandor.\n",
[13125]="700001AD\n1\tFind Erscin\tCarn Dûm lies far to the west of Tármunn Súrsa. Éa begged you to find her missing husband, the hillman-warrior called Erscin.\n2\tSpeak to Erscin\tErscin is at Carn Dûm, far to the west of Gath Forthnír. Erscin is waiting to speak with you again.\n3\tTalk to Éa\tÉa is at Tármunn Súrsa, east of Carn Dûm. You found Erscin, alive and well, within Carn Dûm and returned him to safety. You should let Éa know the good tidings.\n",
[13126]="7006B752\n1\tSpeak with Galâmka to learn more\tSpeak with Galâmka to learn more about the situation in Urash Dâr.\n2\tSpeak with Thugóch to learn more about the people here\tSpeak with Thugóch to learn more about the Ordâkhai in Urash Dâr.\n3\tReturn to Galâmka\tReturn to Galâmka after learning more about the situation in Urash Dâr.\n",
[13127]="7004428F\n1\tSpeak with Talfadan\tTalfadan can be found at Pel Dúven, north-east of the South-gate. You should try and talk some sense into Talfadan.\n2\tCollect farm tools (total: 9)\tFarming tools can be found around Pel Dúven. You should gather the farming tools for Talfadan.\n3\tLook around for any more farm tools\tLook around for any more farm tools.\n4\tCollect the final farm tool for Talfadan\tThe last farm tool is located in the fields at Pel Dúven. Collect the final farm tool for Talfadan.\n5\tBring the farm tools to Talfadan\tTalfadan is at Pel Dúven. Return to Talfadan with the farm tools.\n",
[13128]="700367CA\n1\tTravel to the the Party Tree\tThe beautiful summer days and mild nights have everyone in a festive mood! Start your Summer Festival celebrations at the Party Tree.\n2\tTravel to the Party tree to participate in the Summer Festival\tThe beautiful summer days and mild nights have everyone in a festive mood! Start your Summer Festival celebrations at the Party Tree. After accepting this quest, you will get a map. Use the map to travel to the Party Tree and join in the Festival.\n",
[13129]="700033DC\n1\tSeek Gellir Goldentongue or any sign of his passing\tGellir went to the westernmost of the two Dourhand-encampments north of Gondamon. Áskell has asked you to look for his brother, Gellir Goldentongue. He fears that Gellir has been treacherously slain and seeks any word of his passing. Gellir carried his gleaming shield everywhere, a famous heirloom of their family.\n2\tRecover Gellir's shield\tGellir's shield lies atop his grave in the Dourhand encampment. It is clear that Gellir and his party were slain. You should recover Gellir's shield and return it to Áskell in Gondamon.\n3\tBring Gellir's shield to Áskell\tÁskell is in Gondamon, south of the Dourhand encampment. You have recovered Gellir's shield and should return it to Áskell.\n",
[13130]="70032C28\n1\tCollect White Hand helms (total: 7)\tWhite Hand Orcs can be found in the northern region of the Redhorn Lodes. Ingifast has asked you to collect a few pieces of White Hand Orc armour, to help determine why they are superior in their struggle with the Moria Orcs for sole control of the Redhorn's bountiful resources.\n2\tBring the White Hand helms to Knakk's camp-site\tKnakk is located on the elevated platform just north of the White Hand Orcs' encampment, on the road towards the Grand Stair. Knakk will assess the helmets and send them back to Ingifast, who will be pleased to see all the White Hand helms that you claimed as trophies.\n",
[13131]="7002FE46\n1\tFind Sigeric in Snowbourn\tFastred believes the man you saved to be resting somewhere in Snowbourn near the walls. Fastred wants you to speak with the man you saved from the croft near Garsfeld.\n2\tGain Sigeric's attention with a polite cough\tThe man you saved, Sigeric, is resting in Snowbourn near the walls. You have found the man, but he appears to be deep in thought... perhaps you can politely draw his attention?\n3\tTalk to Sigeric\tThe man you saved is resting in Snowbourn near the walls. Sigeric is now paying attention to you. You should speak with him and learn what he experienced at the croft, as well as any other information he might have on the recent Orc-siege.\n",
[13132]="70071E02\n1\tDefeat guardian bees in Medân Makhai (total: 8)\030Recover honey from honey deposits in Medân Makhai (total: 7)\030Recover abandoned tools in Medân Makhai (total: 5)\tDefeat the enraged guardian bees and collect honey and abandoned tools from Medân Makhai.\n2\tFind and defeat the queen's protectors in Medân Makhai (total: 2)\tFind and defeat the queen's protectors in Medân Makhai.\n3\tFind and defeat the queen bee within Medân Makhai\tFind and defeat the queen bee within Medân Makhai.\n",
[13133]="7000D780\n1\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Abb\tNethraw can be found at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. You should take the sword you found to Nethraw.\n",
[13134]="700085DF\n1\tUse Stone marker\tThe Sword of Arvedui is supposedly hidden somewhere around Gabilshathûr. Nethraw has asked you to search Gabilshathûr for some evidence that the Sword of Arvedui was hidden there.\n2\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Arvedui\tNethraw is back at the Fane of the Seven Sentinels east, of Gabilshathûr. You should bring the Sword of Arvedui to Nethraw.\n",
[13135]="700085E7\n1\tUse Stone marker\tThe Sword of Gondor is said to be found somewhere in Maethad, north of the Fane of the Seven Sentinels. Nethraw has now asked you to search for the Sword of Gondor, in Maethad, a place garrisoned by many Trolls and Gertheryg. For this reason, you were cautioned not to venture there on your own.\n2\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Gondor\tNethraw is back at the Fane of the Seven Sentinels, east of Gabilshathûr. You should bring the Sword of Gondor to Nethraw.\n",
[13136]="7000D782\n1\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Guinokh\tNethraw can be found at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. You should take the sword you found to Nethraw.\n",
[13137]="7000D783\n1\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Innis\tNethraw can be found at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. You should take the sword you found to Nethraw.\n",
[13138]="7000D784\n1\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Kevoka\tNethraw can be found at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. You should bring the sword you found to Nethraw.\n",
[13139]="7000D785\n1\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Kolmak\tNethraw can be found at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. You should take the sword you found to Nethraw.\n",
[13140]="7000D786\n1\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Mánas\tNethraw can be found at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. You should take the sword you found to Nethraw.\n",
[13141]="700085E2\n1\tUse Stone marker\tThe Sword of Rhudaur may be found at one of the fortified Orc-camps north of Gabilshathûr. Nethraw has now asked you to search for the Sword of Rhudaur.\n2\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Rhudaur\tNethraw is back at the Fane of the Seven Sentinels, east of Gabilshathûr. You should bring the Sword of Rhudaur to Nethraw.\n",
[13142]="700085E8\n1\tUse Stone marker\tThe Sword of Slaughter is said to be found in a ruin in some high hills west of the large lake in Imlad Balchorth.. Nethraw has sent you to recover the Sword of Slaughter. You have been cautioned that it will be difficult to obtain without allies.\n2\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Slaughter\tNethraw is back at the Fane of the Seven Sentinels, east of Gabilshathûr. You should bring the Sword of Slaughter to Nethraw.\n",
[13143]="700085E9\n1\tUse Stone marker\030Collect The Sword of Sorrow\tThe Sword of Sorrow is said to be found in drake-infested heights east of the Fane of the Seven Sentinels. You have been sent to recover the Sword of Sorrow from its resting-place. Nethraw again suggests you take allies.\n2\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Sorrow\tNethraw is back at the Fane of the Seven Sentinels, east of Gabilshathûr. You should bring the Sword of Sorrow to Nethraw.\n",
[13144]="700085EB\n1\tUse Stone marker\tThe Sword of Twilight is in a lair of spiders far to the north, near Gath Forthnír. Nethraw has sent you in search of the Sword of Twilight, It seems once again that allies will be required to obtain the Sword from its hiding-place.\n2\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Twilight\tNethraw is back at the Fane of the Seven Sentinels, east of Gabilshathûr. You should bring the Sword of Twilight to Nethraw.\n",
[13145]="700085EA\n1\tUse Stone marker\tThe Sword of the Vigil is somewhere in Nan Gurth. Nethraw told you the last of the seven swords may be found in a deadly place called Nan Gurth. He again warned you that allies will be required to obtain the sword.\n2\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of the Vigil\tNethraw is back at the Fane of the Seven Sentinels, east of Gabilshathûr. You should bring the Sword of the Vigil to Nethraw.\n",
[13146]="7000D781\n1\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Sword of Ánraig\tNethraw can be found at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. You should take the sword you found to Nethraw.\n",
[13147]="7004CE91\n1\tTalk to Sangemêkh Turáh\tYou should talk to Sangemêkh Turáh, who stands by Enkárvo in the Dorwinion refugee camp, across the river east of Dale.\n2\tAccuse Athálrik in Dale\tYou should return to the Great-keep in Dale and relate the accusations against Athálrik.\n3\tLook for Athálrik on Wardman's Way\tYou should look for Athálrik on Wardman's Way, which lies west of the canal on the southern side of Dale.\n4\tQuestion Kelda\tYou should talk to the man who caught your eye on Warden's Way in Dale and learn if he knows of Athálrik's whereabouts.\n5\tLook for Athálrik in the Burnwater House in Lake-town\tYou should look for Athálrik in the Burnwater House in Lake-town.\n6\tLook for the old forester Víthog\tYou should look for the old forester Víthog by his cabin, up in the hills west of Lake-town.\n7\tYou should defeat the ambushers you encountered while looking for the old forester Víthog, whose cabin is up in the hills north-west of Lake-town.\t\n8\tLook for the old forester Víthog\tYou should continue looking for the old forester, Víthog, whose cabin is up in the hills west of Lake-town.\n9\tTalk to Víthog\tYou have found Víthog chopping wood by his cabin, in the hills west of Lake-town. You should talk to Víthog and ask if he knows of Athálrik's whereabouts.\n",
[13148]="7002FE48\n1\tDestroy tainted food-crates within Snowbourn (total: 8)\tCrates of food can be found scattered about Snowbourn. Gísling wants you to investigate crates of food in Snowbourn for any sign of a rampant crop-disease.\n2\tTalk to Gísling\tGísling can be found in northern Snowbourn. You should return to Gísling and let him know that you have done as he asked.\n",
[13149]="70047A89\n1\tTaint Orc food supplies (total: 10)\tMaggot larvae can be found within the caverns of Skoironk. You should taint the Orc food supplies in Skoironk.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have tainted much of the Orc food supplies in Skoironk.\n",
[13150]="700006EA\n1\tCollect bark strips from corrupted stumps (total: 9)\tThere are many corrupted stumps in the north-west of Agamaur. Radagast has asked you to gather bark from the corrupted tree-stumps in Agamaur, so that he may continue his study into Ivar's means of causing the corruption. He warns you that Agamaur should not be traversed alone. You should gather allies.\n2\tDeliver the bark strips to Radagast\tRadagast is in the Eglan-camp in the southern parts of Agamaur. The task was not simple, for enemies were abundant in the swamp, but you managed to gather nine strips of bark for Radagast. You should return to the Wizard with your bounty.\n",
[13151]="70043E01\n1\tListen to Dulglok give you orders\030Listen to Shíktarb give you orders\030Listen to Khúrhosh give you orders\tOrc captains can be found in the main strongholds of the Morgul army. You should speak with the other Orc captains of the Morgul army.\n",
[13152]="70061421\n1\tSearch for Ashenfell's den\tAshenfell's paw prints can be found in the hills east of Nobottle. Diamond has asked you to track the lynx, Ashenfell, back to her den.\n2\tSearch for Ashenfell's den\tAshenfell's paw prints can be found in the hills east of Nobottle. Diamond has asked you to track the lynx, Ashenfell, back to her den.\n3\tSpeak to Adamanda\tDiamond is near Ashenfell's den, outside of Nobottle. Diamond is waiting to speak with you.\n4\tPlace warning flags (total: 6)\tAshenfell's den is east of Nobottle. Diamond has asked you to place flags about the lynx's den to warn folk away from the site.\n5\tTalk to Adamanda\tDiamond is near Ashenfell's den, outside of Nobottle. Diamond is waiting to speak with you.\n6\tTownsfolk can be found in and around Nobottle. Adamanda has asked you to help get the word out about the lynx's den.\t\n7\tReturn to Adamanda\tDiamond is in Nobottle. Diamond is waiting to speak with you.\n8\tTalk to Rosalinda\tRosalinda can be found in Long Cleeve. You should alert Rosalinda North-took to the presence of the lynx's den and inform her of the precautions you and Adamanda have taken to protect the village.\n",
})
